{{!
    @template tool_vae/scope_box

    What a vaeiste says is outside their activity, as a section: its heading, then the list of the marks (the code in
    bold, its label, the day it was said, the note) and the sentence that it exempts from nothing, or the sentence that
    there is none; the link to change it, for the vaeiste. Nothing when there is nothing to show. Inside an item the
    parts touch with only the spaces of before.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\scope_box. The template holds no logic. Every
    text and address is escaped (double braces). One key is HTML (triple braces): headinghtml, a heading made by the core
    ($output->heading()).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * show - bool, whether there is a section to draw
    * headinghtml - HTML, the heading of the section
    * hasmarks - bool, whether there is a list
    * marks - array of {key, label (false or {text}), said, note (false or {text})}
    * sentence - string, the sentence under the list
    * none - false, or a string: the sentence drawn when there is no mark
    * manage - false, or {url, label}: the link to change it

    Example context (json):
    {
        "show": true,
        "headinghtml": "<h3>Outside my activity</h3>",
        "hasmarks": true,
        "marks": [{"key": "RS00000-C02", "label": {"text": "Aider au lever"}, "said": "said on 1 June 2026", "note": false}],
        "sentence": "This exempts from nothing.",
        "none": false,
        "manage": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/scope.php", "label": "Change it"}
    }
}}
{{#show}}
<section class="tool-vae-scope mb-4">
{{{headinghtml}}}
{{#hasmarks}}
<ul>{{#marks}}<li><strong>{{key}}</strong>{{#label}} — {{text}}{{/label}} {{said}}{{!
}}{{#note}}<div class="small">{{text}}</div>{{/note}}</li>{{/marks}}</ul>
<p class="small text-muted">{{sentence}}</p>
{{/hasmarks}}
{{#none}}
<p>{{none}}</p>
{{/none}}
{{#manage}}
<div><a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a></div>
{{/manage}}
</section>
{{/show}}
